Error: Jet.UseAfterMove: `r` was consumed by `hold`, so it can't be used here
  --> Tests/UI/loop_resource_move_next_iteration.jet:16:32
    |
 16 |     loop round in 0..<3 { hold(r) }
    |                                ^
  --> Tests/UI/loop_resource_move_next_iteration.jet:16:32
    |
 16 |     loop round in 0..<3 { hold(r) }
    |                                ^ `r` moved to `hold` here on an earlier loop iteration
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `r` after the move, or give `hold` a copy with `r.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UseAfterMove

